      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "My panels were only installed today. My meter upgrade won't occur for 2 months. All appears good.Solaris were able to bring my installation ahead by a month which was great.So far their service has been good and I have no complaints.Recently, a friend tried to get a system the same as mine (components, size, price) but he could not find anyone to match Solaris and still be able to guarantee to complete the installation by June 30, 2011.I appreciate the information provided on your site. It enabled me to understand what I needed in a PV installation and then be able to ask the right questions to be able to compare companies and then make a decision. Thank you.",
